==English==

===Etymology===
Coined by [[nudist]]s, who may oppose this compulsion.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{context|naturism|lang=en}} Disallowing or discouraging nudity, thus requiring the wearing of clothes, especially [[swimsuit]]s, e.g. on beaches, as opposed to [[clothing optional]] and [[clothes free]]. [[textile|Textile]].

====Synonyms====
* [[body negative]]
* [[clothes minded]]